# The corpus grows as the fuzzer runs; only the checked-in seeds are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!*.seed
# A directory per harness, admitted by pattern rather than by name.
#
# This used to read `!stream/` and `!tar/`, and adding the `name` harness showed
# why that rots: **an excluded directory blocks every negation inside it**, so a
# third directory's seeds were silently un-addable. `git status` stays clean, the
# seeds work in the tree where they were written, and they are absent from every
# clone - which is the same failure `.gitignore` at the top of this repository
# already carries a paragraph about for `tests/data/**`.
#
# `make check-fixtures` is the gate; this comment is why it exists.
!*/
